Cyclone DDS and Cyclone DDS C++ are statically linked into libigris_c_sdk_lib.a, and through it
into the Python extension module. pybind11 is compiled into the Python extension module only.
The ROS 2 message types are generated from the ROS 2 interface definitions and compiled into
libigris_c_sdk_lib.a and the Python extension module.
Headers and libraries are provided in the thirdparty/ directory for compilation purposes.

